            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Thinkbyte.ai plans to launch two campaigns: one targeting Shopify users with quarterly newsletters, and another for influencer outreach using email retargeting on platforms like Instagram and TikTok.",
