              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Mailmodo will be used for Shopify integration due to its native support, while alternative tools will be considered for influencer outreach to address spam risks. Charan expressed need for clear communication to avoid future misunderstandings.",
