              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Concerns arose regarding potential spam issues and domain reputation risks with influencer outreach campaign. Miscommunication about email marketing process and campaign requirements led to confusion.",
