        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Challenges highlighted in managing AWS accounts for SMTP configuration, along with implications of shared IPs on domain reputation. Charan noted Netcore provided more comprehensive support for managing these technical aspects.",
