            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Guidance will be provided on setting up AWS for SMTP use while maintaining domain reputation. Mailmodo does not offer direct management of AWS accounts, unlike Netcore, which offers more extensive support.",
